# Stonetalon Mountains (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and formulas whose SOURCE is
# physically in Stonetalon Mountains for a Horde player, verified against the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Three
# recipes are vendor-sold in-zone by Horde or neutral vendors (every buy line
# carries an npc pin to the exact in-zone vendor); four more drop from narrow
# in-zone sources and nowhere else, or nearly nowhere else, in the data.
# Recipes sold only by Alliance-faction vendors are excluded (Alterac rule,
# flipped — see docs/stonetalon-horde-companions-inventory.md), every other
# Stonetalon-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest
# records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover
# those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it
# cleanly. Tailoring, Leatherworking, First Aid and Fishing have no
# in-zone Horde source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/stonetalon-horde-recipes
title Stonetalon Mountains (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns
levels 12-30
zone Stonetalon Mountains
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords stonetalon, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Alchemy — Sun Rock Retreat (Jeeda)

  when skill Alchemy 1

  vendor 4083 -- Jeeda (47.61, 61.59), Apprentice Witch Doctor
  buy 6055 "Recipe: Fire Protection Potion" npc 4083
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Enchanting — the south (Kulwia)

  when skill Enchanting 1

  vendor 12043 -- Kulwia (45.39, 59.33), Trade Supplies
  buy 11039 "Formula: Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility" npc 12043
  buy 11101 "Formula: Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength" npc 12043
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.
  note Kulwia also sells the Copper Rod tool — a tool, not a recipe, so it is not ridden here.

step Engineering — the east (Veenix)

  when skill Engineering 1

  vendor 4086 -- Veenix (58.22, 51.74), Venture Co. Merchant
  buy 7561 "Schematic: Goblin Jumper Cables" npc 4086
  note Veenix is neutral and serves both factions; this is his Stonetalon point. Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Cooking — Windshear (rare drop)

  when skill Cooking 1

  loop
  goto 73.13,61.06
  goto 73.53,58.74
  goto 73.8,59.26
  goto 73.92,59.62
  goto 74.43,58.39
  goto 75.67,59.2
  collect 249880 "Recipe: Royal Tea" optional
  note Dropped only by the Windshear Geomancer (level 20); the recipe drops nowhere else in the data.

