step Enchanting — the Charred Vale (rare drop)

  when skill Enchanting 1

  loop
  goto 30.89,64.73
  goto 30.45,68.08
  goto 32.73,72.79
  goto 32.8,63.45
  goto 32.89,63.2
  goto 34.15,67.58
  collect 11151 "Formula: Enchant Gloves - Herbalism" optional
  note Dropped by the Charred Ancient, the Blackened Ancient and the Vengeful Ancient — a tight in-zone family — plus two out-of-zone droppers; narrow, not zone-exclusive.

step Tailoring, Leatherworking, First Aid, Fishing — no Horde source

  note The data holds no Tailoring, Leatherworking, First Aid or Fishing recipe sourced in Stonetalon Mountains for Horde players: no servable in-zone vendor sells one and no in-zone mob drops one. (The in-zone Alliance vendors Harlown Darkweave and Janet Hommers sell a pattern and two cooking recipes, but they are Alliance-faction — see the inventory doc.) Polestar's own profession guides cover those professions' progression.
